  "description": "The Tealium MAUI integration brings support for Tealium's Native iOS and Android SDKs to the .NET MAUI platform. This package provides a single cross-platform API, enabling you to develop with Tealium once for both iOS and Android platforms. The Tealium Native SDKs for iOS and Android are embedded along with the lifecycle libraries.",
